{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，齊侯伐徐。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"二、楚子誘戎曼子，殺之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"楚子何以不名？夷狄相誘，君子不疾也。曷為不疾？若不疾，乃疾之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"三、夏，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"四、秋八月己亥，晉侯夷卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"五、九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"六、季孫隱如如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_196_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_196","textTraditional":"七、冬十月，葬晉昭公。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}